  "title": "Soy Eggs (Shoyu Tamago)",
  "description": "Perfect in ramen, these soy eggs are boiled then soaked in a symphony of low-sodium soy sauce, mirin, ponzu, green onions, and togarashi.",
  "authors": [
    "Epicure Amber"
  ],
